OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for Ulster Unionist
OL,4,AParty after turbulent week?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother rambunctious week in the
OL,7,Fturbulent life of the Ulster Unionist
OL,8,FParty (UUP) ended with, of all things,
OL,9,Fan away day.
OL,11,FYes, an away day!
OL,13,FA nice Friday opportunity to chew over
OL,14,Fwhere the party stands now and where it
OL,15,Fwishes to go. Over coffee and
OL,16,Fcroissants.
OL,18,FRobbie Butler was there for as long as
OL,19,Fhis now-busy diary would allow. And
OL,20,Fperhaps more surprisingly, Mike
OL,21,FNesbitt, given what had just happened.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
